{"pageProps": {"params": {"versionId": "59", "usfm": "PRO.8.NIV"}, "audioVersionInfo": {"title": "ESV Hear the Word Audio Bible", "copyright_long": {"text": "English: ESV Audio Old and New Testament", "html": "English: ESV Audio Old and New Testament"}, "copyright_short": {"text": "\u2117 2016 Crossway", "html": "<p>\u2117 2016 Crossway</p>"}, "version_id": 59, "id": 1, "publisher_link": "", "dramatized": false, "publisher": {"id": 575, "name": "Hear Book Audio", "local_name": "Hear Book Audio", "url": null, "description": null}}, "type": "chapter", "chapterInfo": {"audioChapterInfo": [{"download_urls": {"format_mp3_32k": "//audio-bible-cdn.youversionapi.com/1/32k/PRO/8-4235d87dcc53ef1b888129d8c93b703c.mp3?version_id=59", "format_hls": "//audio-hls.youversionapi.com/1/m4a/32k/PRO/8-4235d87dcc53ef1b888129d8c93b703c.m3u8?version_id=59"}, "id": 1, "version_id": 59, "title": "ESV Hear the Word Audio Bible", "timing_available": true, "dramatized": false, "default": true}], "content": "<div class=\"version vid59 iso6393eng\" data-vid=\"59\" data-iso6393=\"eng\">\n    <div class=\"book bkPRO\">\n        <div class=\"chapter ch8\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8\">\n            <div class=\"label\">8</div><div class=\"s1\"><span class=\"heading\">The Blessings of Wisdom</span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"verse v1\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.1\"><span class=\"label\">1</span><span class=\"content\">Does not </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 1:20 </span></span><span class=\"content\">wisdom call?</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v1\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.1\"><span class=\"content\">Does not </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Job 28:12</span></span><span class=\"content\">understanding raise her voice?</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v1\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.1\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.2\"><span class=\"label\">2</span><span class=\"content\">On </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 9:3, 14</span></span><span class=\"content\">the heights beside the way,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.2\"><span class=\"content\">at the crossroads she takes her stand;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.2\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.3\"><span class=\"label\">3</span><span class=\"content\">beside </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 1:21 </span></span><span class=\"content\">the gates in front of </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Job 29:7</span></span><span class=\"content\">the town,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.3\"><span class=\"content\">at the entrance of the portals she cries aloud:</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.3\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.4\"><span class=\"label\">4</span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;To you, O </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Ps. 49:1, 2]</span></span><span class=\"content\">men, I call,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.4\"><span class=\"content\">and my cry is to </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Ps. 49:1, 2]</span></span><span class=\"content\">the children of man.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.4\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.5\"><span class=\"label\">5</span><span class=\"content\">O </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See ch. 1:4 </span></span><span class=\"content\">simple ones, learn </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ver. 12 </span></span><span class=\"content\">prudence;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.5\"><span class=\"content\">O </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 1:22]</span></span><span class=\"content\">fools, learn sense.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.5\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.6\"><span class=\"label\">6</span><span class=\"content\">Hear, for I will speak </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 22:20] </span></span><span class=\"content\">noble things,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.6\"><span class=\"content\">and from my lips will come </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 23:16</span></span><span class=\"content\">what is right,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.6\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.7\"><span class=\"label\">7</span><span class=\"content\">for my </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 37:30</span></span><span class=\"content\">mouth will utter truth;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.7\"><span class=\"content\">wickedness is an abomination to my lips.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.7\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.8\"><span class=\"label\">8</span><span class=\"content\">All the words of my mouth are righteous;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.8\"><span class=\"content\">there is nothing </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Deut. 32:5</span></span><span class=\"content\">twisted or crooked in them.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.8\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.9\"><span class=\"label\">9</span><span class=\"content\">They are all </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 14:6; 1 Cor. 2:10]</span></span><span class=\"content\">straight to him who understands,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.9\"><span class=\"content\">and right to those who find knowledge.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.9\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.10\"><span class=\"label\">10</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ver. 19; ch. 3:14; Ps. 119:72, 127  </span></span><span class=\"content\">Take my instruction instead of silver,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.10\"><span class=\"content\">and knowledge rather than choice gold,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.10\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.11\"><span class=\"label\">11</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [ch. 16:16]; See Job 28:12-19   </span></span><span class=\"content\">for wisdom is better than jewels,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.11\"><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 3:15</span></span><span class=\"content\">all that you may desire cannot compare with her.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.11\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.12\"><span class=\"label\">12</span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;I, wisdom, dwell with prudence,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.12\"><span class=\"content\">and I find knowledge and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 1:4</span></span><span class=\"content\">discretion.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.12\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.13\"><span class=\"label\">13</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [ch. 16:6]   </span></span><span class=\"content\">The fear of the </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\"> is </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Ps. 97:10 </span></span><span class=\"content\">hatred of evil.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.13\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [ch. 6:17; 16:5]   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Pride and arrogance and the way of evil</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.13\"><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 2:12; 4:24</span></span><span class=\"content\">perverted speech I hate.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.13\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.14\"><span class=\"label\">14</span><span class=\"content\">I have </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Isa. 11:2; [Isa. 9:6] </span></span><span class=\"content\">counsel and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 2:7] </span></span><span class=\"content\">sound wisdom;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.14\"><span class=\"content\">I have insight; </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Eccles. 7:19; [Ps. 89:19]</span></span><span class=\"content\">I have strength.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.14\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.15\"><span class=\"label\">15</span><span class=\"content\">By me </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[Dan. 2:21; Rom. 13:1; Rev. 19:16]</span></span><span class=\"content\">kings reign,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.15\"><span class=\"content\">and rulers decree what is just;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.15\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.16\"><span class=\"label\">16</span><span class=\"content\">by me princes rule,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.16\"><span class=\"content\">and nobles, all who govern justly.</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">8:16 </span><span class=\"ft\">Most Hebrew manuscripts; many Hebrew manuscripts, Septuagint </span><span class=\"fq\">govern the earth</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.16\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.17\"><span class=\"label\">17</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 91:14; John 14:21; [1 Sam. 2:30]   </span></span><span class=\"content\">I love those who love me,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.17\"><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">James 1:5; [ch. 1:28]</span></span><span class=\"content\">those who seek me diligently find me.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.17\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.18\"><span class=\"label\">18</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    ch. 3:16   </span></span><span class=\"content\">Riches and honor are with me,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.18\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 112:3; [Matt. 6:33; Luke 16:11; Eph. 3:8]  </span></span><span class=\"content\">enduring wealth and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 112:3; [Matt. 6:33; Luke 16:11; Eph. 3:8]</span></span><span class=\"content\">righteousness.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.18\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.19\"><span class=\"label\">19</span><span class=\"content\">My fruit is </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 3:14 </span></span><span class=\"content\">better than </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ver. 10 </span></span><span class=\"content\">gold, even fine gold,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.19\"><span class=\"content\">and my yield than </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 10:20</span></span><span class=\"content\">choice silver.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.19\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.20\"><span class=\"label\">20</span><span class=\"content\">I walk in the way of righteousness,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.20\"><span class=\"content\">in the paths of justice,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.20\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v21\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.21\"><span class=\"label\">21</span><span class=\"content\">granting an inheritance to those who love me,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v21\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.21\"><span class=\"content\">and filling their treasuries.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v21\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.21\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v22\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.22\"><span class=\"label\">22</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    See Job 28:25-28   </span></span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;The </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Gen. 14:19, 22; [Ps. 104:24; 136:5] </span></span><span class=\"content\">possessed</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">8:22 </span><span class=\"ft\">Or </span><span class=\"fq\">fathered</span><span class=\"ft\">; Septuagint </span><span class=\"fq\">created</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> me at the beginning of his work,</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">8:22 </span><span class=\"ft\">Hebrew </span><span class=\"fq\">way</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v22\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.22\"><span class=\"content\">the first of his acts </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 93:2</span></span><span class=\"content\">of old.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v22\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.22\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v23\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.23\"><span class=\"label\">23</span><span class=\"content\">Ages ago I was </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 2:6 </span></span><span class=\"content\">set up,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v23\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.23\"><span class=\"content\">at the first, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[John 17:5]</span></span><span class=\"content\">before the beginning of the earth.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v23\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.23\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v24\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.24\"><span class=\"label\">24</span><span class=\"content\">When there were no </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ver. 27, 28; ch. 3:20; Gen. 1:2 </span></span><span class=\"content\">depths I was </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Job 15:7; Ps. 51:5</span></span><span class=\"content\">brought forth,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v24\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.24\"><span class=\"content\">when there were no springs abounding with water.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v24\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.24\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v25\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.25\"><span class=\"label\">25</span><span class=\"content\">Before the mountains </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Job 38:6 (Heb.) </span></span><span class=\"content\">had been shaped,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v25\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.25\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 90:2\n        </span></span><span class=\"content\">before the hills, I was brought forth,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v25\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.25\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v26\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.26\"><span class=\"label\">26</span><span class=\"content\">before he had made the earth with its fields,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v26\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.26\"><span class=\"content\">or the first of the dust of the world.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v26\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.26\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v27\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.27\"><span class=\"label\">27</span><span class=\"content\">When he </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 3:19 </span></span><span class=\"content\">established the heavens, I was there;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v27\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.27\"><span class=\"content\">when he drew </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Job 26:10</span></span><span class=\"content\">a circle on the face of the deep,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v27\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.27\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v28\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.28\"><span class=\"label\">28</span><span class=\"content\">when he </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Gen. 1:6</span></span><span class=\"content\">made firm the skies above,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v28\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.28\"><span class=\"content\">when he established</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">8:28 </span><span class=\"ft\">The meaning of the Hebrew is uncertain</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> the fountains of the deep,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v28\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.28\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v29\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.29\"><span class=\"label\">29</span><span class=\"content\">when he </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Gen. 1:9, 10 </span></span><span class=\"content\">assigned to the sea its </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Job 26:10 </span></span><span class=\"content\">limit,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v29\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.29\"><span class=\"content\">so that the waters might not transgress his command,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v29\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.29\"><span class=\"content\">when he marked out </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Ps. 104:5</span></span><span class=\"content\">the foundations of the earth,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v29\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.29\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v30\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.30\"><span class=\"label\">30</span><span class=\"content\">then </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Zech. 13:7; [John 1:1, 2] </span></span><span class=\"content\">I was beside him, like a master workman,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v30\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.30\"><span class=\"content\">and I was daily his</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">8:30 </span><span class=\"ft\">Or </span><span class=\"fq\">daily filled with</span></span></span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 16:3; [Matt. 3:17]</span></span><span class=\"content\">delight,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v30\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.30\"><span class=\"content\">rejoicing before him always,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v30\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.30\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v31\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.31\"><span class=\"label\">31</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [Gen. 1:31; Ps. 104:31]   </span></span><span class=\"content\">rejoicing in his </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Isa. 45:18</span></span><span class=\"content\">inhabited world</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v31\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.31\"><span class=\"content\">and delighting in the children of man.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v31\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.31\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v32\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.32\"><span class=\"label\">32</span><span class=\"content\">&#8220;And now, </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 5:7; 7:24; [1 John 3:1] </span></span><span class=\"content\">O sons, listen to me:</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v32\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.32\"><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ps. 119:1, 2; 128:1, 2; [Luke 11:28]  </span></span><span class=\"content\">blessed are those who keep my ways.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v32\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.32\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v33\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.33\"><span class=\"label\">33</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    See ch. 4:1  </span></span><span class=\"content\">Hear instruction and be wise,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v33\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.33\"><span class=\"content\">and do not neglect it.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v33\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.33\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v34\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.34\"><span class=\"label\">34</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    [ch. 3:13]  </span></span><span class=\"content\">Blessed is the one who listens to me,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v34\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.34\"><span class=\"content\">watching daily at my gates,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v34\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.34\"><span class=\"content\">waiting beside my doors.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v34\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.34\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v35\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.35\"><span class=\"label\">35</span><span class=\"content\">For </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 3:18; See ch. 4:22 </span></span><span class=\"content\">whoever finds me </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">John 1:4; 17:3 </span></span><span class=\"content\">finds life</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v35\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.35\"><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 12:2; 18:22</span></span><span class=\"content\">obtains favor from the </span><span class=\"nd\"><span class=\"content\">Lord</span></span><span class=\"content\">,</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v35\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.35\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v36\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.36\"><span class=\"label\">36</span><span class=\"content\">but he who fails to find me </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[ch. 15:32; 20:2; 29:24] </span></span><span class=\"content\">injures himself;</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v36\" data-usfm=\"PRO.8.36\"><span class=\"content\">all who </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 12:1 </span></span><span class=\"content\">hate me </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">ch. 21:6</span></span><span class=\"content\">love death.&#8221;</span></span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>", "copyright": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers."}, "next": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["PRO.9"], "human": "Proverbs 9", "toc": true, "version_id": 59}, "previous": {"canonical": true, "usfm": ["PRO.7"], "human": "Proverbs 7", "toc": true, "version_id": 59}, "reference": {"usfm": ["PRO.8"], "human": "Proverbs 8", "version_id": 59}}, "usfm": "PRO.8.NIV", "locale": "en", "versionData": {"audio": true, "copyright_short": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by Crossway, a publishing ministry of Good News Publishers.</p>", "text": "The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), c